    {
      "id": "T-P006-U002",
      "text": "**定义** $f:(X,\\Sigma_X)\\to(Y,\\Sigma_Y)$。",
      "source_ids": [
        "RA09-P006-U002"
      ],
      "origin": "source",
      "explanation": "按原图保留本单元。",
      "status": "resolved"
    },
    {
      "id": "T-P006-U003",
      "text": "若 $\\forall U\\in\\Sigma_Y$，有 $f^{-1}(U)\\in\\Sigma_X$，则 $f$ 是 $(\\Sigma_X,\\Sigma_Y)$ 可测映射。",
      "source_ids": [
        "RA09-P006-U003"
      ],
      "origin": "source",
      "explanation": "按原图保留本单元。",
      "status": "resolved"
    },
    {
      "id": "T-P006-U004",
      "text": "**引理** 若存在 $\\mathcal D\\subset\\Sigma_Y$，使 $\\sigma(\\mathcal D)=\\Sigma_Y$，",
      "source_ids": [
        "RA09-P006-U004"
      ],
      "origin": "source",
      "explanation": "按原图保留本单元。",
      "status": "resolved"
    },
    {
      "id": "T-P006-U005",
      "text": "则 $f$ 是 $(\\Sigma_X,\\Sigma_Y)$ 可测 $\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal D\\subset\\Sigma_f$。",
      "source_ids": [
        "RA09-P006-U005"
      ],
      "origin": "source",
      "explanation": "按原图保留本单元。",
      "status": "resolved"
    },
    {
      "id": "T-P006-U006",
      "text": "仅证 $\\Longleftarrow$。$\\Sigma_f$ 是〔疑字003〕$\\sigma$ 代数。",
      "source_ids": [
        "RA09-P006-U006"
      ],
      "origin": "source",
      "explanation": "按原图保留本单元。",
      "status": "unresolved"
    },
    {
      "id": "T-P006-U007",
      "text": "$\\Sigma_Y\\subset\\Sigma_f$。〔右侧有证明结束小记号。〕",
      "source_ids": [
