    {
      "id": "N-P006-U001",
      "text": "### 可测",
      "source_ids": [
        "RA09-P006-U001"
      ],
      "origin": "source",
      "explanation": "按原图保留本单元。",
      "status": "resolved"
    },
    {
      "id": "N-P006-U002",
      "text": "**定义** $f:(X,\\Sigma_X)\\to(Y,\\Sigma_Y)$。",
      "source_ids": [
        "RA09-P006-U002"
      ],
      "origin": "source",
      "explanation": "按原图保留本单元。",
      "status": "resolved"
    },
    {
      "id": "N-P006-U003",
      "text": "若 $\\forall U\\in\\Sigma_Y$，有 $f^{-1}(U)\\in\\Sigma_X$，则 $f$ 是 $(\\Sigma_X,\\Sigma_Y)$ 可测映射。",
      "source_ids": [
        "RA09-P006-U003"
      ],
      "origin": "source",
      "explanation": "按原图保留本单元。",
      "status": "resolved"
    },
    {
      "id": "N-P006-S01",
      "text": "> [!info] 【条件补充】此处的可测空间\n> $\\Sigma_X$、$\\Sigma_Y$ 均取相应底集上的 $\\sigma$ 代数。可测性由两端的集合族共同决定；同一个点映射改变目标 $\\sigma$ 代数后，可测性的要求也会改变。沿用前页记号 $\\Sigma_f=\\{B\\subset Y:f^{-1}(B)\\in\\Sigma_X\\}$，可测性等价于 $\\Sigma_Y\\subset\\Sigma_f$。",
      "source_ids": [
        "RA09-P006-U002",
        "RA09-P006-U003"
      ],
      "origin": "supplement",
      "explanation": "补明定义中使用的 σ 代数条件与前页记号。",
      "status": "resolved"
    },
    {
      "id": "N-P006-U004",
      "text": "**引理** 若存在 $\\mathcal D\\subset\\Sigma_Y$，使 $\\sigma(\\mathcal D)=\\Sigma_Y$，",
      "source_ids": [
        "RA09-P006-U004"
      ],
      "origin": "source",
      "explanation": "按原图保留本单元。",
      "status": "resolved"
    },
    {
      "id": "N-P006-U005",
      "text": "则 $f$ 是 $(\\Sigma_X,\\Sigma_Y)$ 可测 $\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal D\\subset\\Sigma_f$。",
      "source_ids": [
        "RA09-P006-U005"
      ],
      "origin": "source",
      "explanation": "按原图保留本单元。",
      "status": "resolved"
    },
    {
      "id": "N-P006-U006",
      "text": "仅证 $\\Longleftarrow$。$\\Sigma_f$ 是〔疑字003〕$\\sigma$ 代数。",
      "source_ids": [
        "RA09-P006-U006"
      ],
      "origin": "source",
      "explanation": "按原图保留本单元。",
      "status": "unresolved"
    },
    {
      "id": "N-P006-U007",
      "text": "$\\Sigma_Y\\subset\\Sigma_f$。〔右侧有证明结束小记号。〕",
      "source_ids": [
        "RA09-P006-U007"
      ],
      "origin": "source",
      "explanation": "按原图保留本单元。",
      "status": "resolved"
    },
    {
      "id": "N-P006-S02",
      "text": "> [!info] 【证明补全】生成族判别的两个方向\n> 必要性：若 $f$ 可测，则 $\\Sigma_Y\\subset\\Sigma_f$，所以 $\\mathcal D\\subset\\Sigma_f$。\n>\n> 充分性：假设 $\\mathcal D\\subset\\Sigma_f$。前页已逐项证明：逆像保持全集、补和可列并，因此 $\\Sigma_f$ 是 $Y$ 上的 $\\sigma$ 代数。由生成 $\\sigma$ 代数的最小性，$\\Sigma_Y=\\sigma(\\mathcal D)\\subset\\Sigma_f$，这正是 $f$ 可测。",
      "source_ids": [
        "RA09-P006-U004",
        "RA09-P006-U005",
        "RA09-P006-U007"
      ],
      "origin": "supplement",
      "explanation": "展开原稿省略的必要方向、逆像族封闭性引用及最小性步骤。 本补证关联可辨清的数学公式与定义；未决字形由其独立黑色目标单元及issues保留，不作补证的数学前提。",
      "status": "resolved"
    },
